 {
  "section": "Store settings \u2014 labor rates & money",
  "key": "T",
  "title": "Remember the labor rate each line was agreed at",
  "sub": "A line stores its agreed total but not the rate behind it, so every part of the app that touches money has to special-case \u201cnever re-figure a frozen line\u201d \u2014 five places already, and the last miss put $600 on a line the customer approved at $500.",
  "dims": [
